{"id":"n81109-1-7","stage":4,"title":"퍼붓다 · 瓢泼","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81109-1-7-1","ko":"이렇게 비가 퍼붓는데 어딜 나가겠다는 거니?","zh":"雨下得这么大，你还要去哪儿啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"비가","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비가","audio":"/audio/34e7530f1cc9ef8588ee.mp3"}},{"text":"퍼붓는데","meaning":"瓢泼，滂沱","explanation":"퍼붓다：瓢泼，滂沱；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"퍼붓다","audio":"/audio/c760f1170ef4376f7e2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81109","senseId":"1","lemma":"퍼붓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"퍼붓는데","audio":"/audio/4bc61c6ab42c415a9a53.mp3"}},{"text":"어딜","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어딜","audio":"/audio/f10fe3683e3b73b1fa52.mp3"}},{"text":"나가겠다는","meaning":"去","explanation":"나가다：去；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"8","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가겠다는","audio":"/audio/e395df3937bc6edc9115.mp3"}},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니","audio":"/audio/3e0100c9477501692d3f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"5e0d62698b44a434","term":"비","zh":"雨","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3","entryId":"36681","definition":"高空中形成云朵的水蒸气冷却凝聚后降落而下的水滴。","pronunciation":["비"]},{"id":"c760f1170ef4376f","term":"퍼붓다","zh":"瓢泼，滂沱","audio":"/audio/c760f1170ef4376f7e2c.mp3","entryId":"81109","definition":"雨雪等下得非常大。","pronunciation":["퍼붇따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"因有目的而去某处。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/06d422637fbd03282cb8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81109-1-7-2","ko":"친구랑 약속이 있어서요.","zh":"我和朋友有约在身。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구랑","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구랑","audio":"/audio/74f6c9e10aa7a90f70e1.mp3"}},{"text":"약속이","meaning":"约定，约好，承诺","explanation":"약속：约定，约好，承诺；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"약속","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36695","senseId":"1","lemma":"약속","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약속이","audio":"/audio/9bb29fbf6b1cacbf6712.mp3"}},{"text":"있어서요.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어서요：用礼貌语气补充理由：“因为……”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어서요","audio":"/audio/e3fe1e47c869522a75aa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"a39ee87db456831e","term":"약속","zh":"约定，约好，承诺","audio":"/audio/a39ee87db456831ef069.mp3","entryId":"36695","definition":"事先决定与他人一起做某事；或指那样定下的内容。","pronunciation":["약쏙"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"将要完成或进行某件事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/80ad9c93a8b8d50b7bdd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.356,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81109","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":124,"sequenceScore":2.1827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我和朋友有约在身。","金社长，最近公司的销售额怎么样？","雨下得这么大，你还要去哪儿啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我和朋友有约在身。","雨下得这么大，你还要去哪儿啊？","金社长，最近公司的销售额怎么样？"],"answer":0}]}
